@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557
skinparam activityStartColor #163E52
skinparam activityEndColor #163E52
skinparam wrapWidth 190
skinparam maxMessageSize 180

title CF-M09 — Refinement, Sprint planning and Sprint completion
start
:CF-M09-S01\nInitiating actor\nAuthorized participant requests\nrefinement, Sprint-plan change or\na separate Sprint-end action.;
if (CF-M09-S02\nCurrent project/item/Sprint\nauthority and applicable state\nvalid?) then (yes)
if (CF-M09-S03\nRequest is item refinement?) then (yes)
:CF-M09-S04\nParticipant\nClarify item outcome/criteria and\nrefine tasks;
:CF-M09-S05\nSystem\nRetain item/task relationships and\nseparate progress/acceptance;
:CF-M09-S06\nSystem\nUse CF-M17 to classify actual\nresult; return only evidence-\nsupported effect;
stop
else (no)
if (CF-M09-S07\nRequest is Sprint end/cancel?) then (yes)
:CF-M09-S08\nParticipant\nRecord actual period outcome, goal\nresult and item disposition;
:CF-M09-S09\nSystem\nRetain incomplete work; require\nexplicit disposition without\nautomatic carryover;
:CF-M09-S10\nSystem\nApply reviewed permitted Sprint\ntransition;
:CF-M09-S11\nSystem\nUse CF-M17 to classify actual\nresult; return only evidence-\nsupported effect;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M09-S12\nParticipant\nIdentify coherent Sprint Goal,\nselected items and delivery plan;
:CF-M09-S13\nSystem\nEvaluate readiness separately from\nTo do/In progress/Done;
if (CF-M09-S14\nSelection/plan change permitted\nand coherent?) then (yes)
:CF-M09-S15\nSystem\nSave one composite Sprint Backlog\nmeaning;
:CF-M09-S16\nSystem\nUse CF-M17 to classify actual\nresult; return only evidence-\nsupported effect;
stop
else (no)
:CF-M09-S17\nSystem\nReport invalid/conflicting plan;\nno automatic readiness or\nacceptance;
stop
endif
endif
endif
else (no)
:CF-M09-S18\nSystem\nDeny before prohibited effect or\nprotected disclosure; report unmet\ngate;
stop
endif
legend bottom
A: accepted profile core only. Other policy detail: P / proposed refinement.
Step IDs identify full descriptions in the activity view.
Logical ordering; no atomicity, runtime, timing or execution proof.
endlegend
@enduml
